The final `1280x720` capture passed content checks: Snow-surface pixels `369181`, footprint-strip dark pixels `4885`, and the image is not a sky-only capture.

## Residual Risk

- At 512 resolution over a 40 m Ground window, a 24 cm footprint radius has limited texel detail. The current result is stable and readable, but final footprint-mask art and perceived depth remain a user visual gate.
- Temp ChildActor/World packages were intentionally not force-deleted in-session because UE 5.6 reproduced an access violation during that cleanup. They are isolated under `/Game/_MCP_Temp`, are not production dependencies, and are excluded from promotion.
